      type: "MCQ",
      text: `<p> Consider the following statements regarding magnetic materials:<br/> 1. Value of spontaneous magnetisation for a paramagnetic material is zero.<br/> 2. Diamagnetic materials have small permanent dipole moment.<br/> 3. In ferromagnetic materials, total magnetic flux density is summation of flux density due to applied field and flux density due to magnetization.<br/>Which of the above given statements are correct? </p>`,
